---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout>
    <section>
        <a class="back" href="/" style="color:#7aa2ff">
            ← Back
        </a>
        <h1>About "Ads"</h1>

        <h2>What are these "ads"?</h2>
        <p>
            These "ads" are just banners that promote stuff like my Discord
            server or some of my projects. So they aren't really ads just
            featuring stuff(that's why I meantion the word ads in "")
        </p>

        <h2>Do these "ads" track me?</h2>
        <p>
            Not really, the "ads" themselves don't contain tracking scripts,
            just links with images. The website does contain anonymous tracking
            using a self-hosted tool called <a href="https://umami.to">Umami</a>
            .
        </p>

        <h2>How do I disable them?</h2>
        <p>
            If you wish to not see them, you can click the button at the bottom
            of every page that says "Hide ads" and that will hide them. The same
            button can also make them visible again if you wish to re-enable
            "ads".
        </p>
    </section>
</BaseLayout>
